{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44803","headline":"送褚先生海上寻封链师 · 法振","name":"送褚先生海上寻封链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潮落风初定，天吴避客舟。\n近承三殿旨，欲向五湖游。\n不厌乌皮几，新缝鹤氅裘。\n明珠漂断岸，阴火映中流。\n华盖芝童引，神丹桂女收。\n悬知居缥缈，因爲识浮丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}